测试方法
重新构建Docker镜像并测试：

docker build --no-cache -t void2md .
docker run -p 3457:3457 void2md


### File Upload

```bash
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer test-key" \
     -F "file=@test.pdf;type=application/pdf" \
     http://localhost:3457/v1/fileparse
```

### Web Crawl
```bash
curl -sS -X POST http://localhost:3457/v1/htmlparse     -H 'Authorization: Bearer test-key'     -H 'Content-Type: application/json'     -d '{"url":"https://support.sangfor.com.cn/productSoftware/list?product_id=220&category_id=226","sele  ctor":".docs-content","maxPage":200}'

curl -sS -X GET http://localhost:3457/v1/htmlparse/hpa_818b9af9e41dab6f    -H 'Authorization: Bearer test-key'     -H 'Content-Type: application/json'

返回数据结构

{
  "status": "pending|running|success|failed|cancelled",
  "pages": 0,
  "markdown": "",
  "items": [],
  "truncated": false,
  "error": ""
}
字段说明
status (string): 任务状态

pending - 任务已提交，等待处理
running - 任务正在执行中
success - 任务成功完成
failed - 任务执行失败
cancelled - 任务已被取消
pages (integer): 已处理的页面数量

markdown (string): 所有页面聚合后的完整 Markdown 内容

items (array): 每个页面的详细结果数组，每个 item 包含：


{
  "url": "页面URL",
  "title": "页面标题", 
  "markdown": "该页面的Markdown内容"
}
truncated (boolean): 结果是否被截断（由于达到大小或页面限制）

error (string): 如果任务失败，这里会包含错误信息

示例响应
成功完成的任务：


{
  "status": "success",
  "pages": 1,
  "markdown": "# 页面标题\n\n页面内容...",
  "items": [
    {
      "url": "https://example.com",
      "title": "页面标题",
      "markdown": "# 页面标题\n\n页面内容..."
    }
  ],
  "truncated": false,
  "error": ""
}
失败的任务：


{
  "status": "failed",
  "pages": 0,
  "markdown": "",
  "items": [],
  "truncated": false,
  "error": "entry page https://example.com failed: request failed: Get \"https://example.com\": dial tcp: i/o timeout"
}
进行中的任务：


{
  "status": "running",
  "pages": 3,
  "markdown": "",
  "items": [],
  "truncated": false,
  "error": ""
}

```